  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Tom has a baseball. He puts it in his bag. He has a blue hat too. Tom goes to the park. Ben is there. \"Let's play!\" says Ben. They play and play. Tom runs and runs. He falls in the sand.",
      "Tom looks at his shoes. They are very dirty. His socks are dirty too. \"Bye, Ben!\" says Tom. He goes home. Mom looks at Tom. \"Oh dear!\" she says. \"Go to the bathroom, please.\" \"Have a bath.\"",
      "Tom has a bath. Is Tom clean now? Yes! Pip comes to the door. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Pip is dirty too! \"Pip, have a bath!\" says Tom. Pip runs to the bed. Mom says, \"Oh no!\" She cleans Pip too. Then Tom is in bed. Pip sleeps next to him."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom plays baseball with Ben and gets dirty. At home he has a bath, and then he goes to bed.",
